WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:05.000
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:15.500
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:30.970
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:35.260
‎THIS STORY IS A FICTION AND ALL NAMES OF FIGURES AND ORGANIZATIONS ARE FICTITIOUS.
MOREOVER, THE STORY HAS NO RELATION TO REAL-LIFE INCIDENTS AND EVENTS.

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:33.720
Here it is.

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:34.640
THIS STORY IS A FICTION AND ALL NAMES OF
FIGURES AND ORGANIZATIONS ARE FICTITIOUS.

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:35.600
MOREOVER, THE STORY HAS NO RELATION
TO REAL-LIFE INCIDENTS AND EVENTS.

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:38.560
Do you not wear a hairpin?

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:40.930
Go wear that then.

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:42.940
I promised him,

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:44.560
so I guess I have no choice.

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:47.020
MAOMAO

00:01:47.110 --> 00:01:48.900
Take a look, Mr. Luomen.

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:53.460
Episode 40: Festering Resentment

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:50.780
This kitty is smart.

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:53.740
When she eats fish,
she leaves the head, tail and innards.

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:57.450
I personally enjoy
the bitter taste of those parts.

00:01:58.030 --> 00:02:00.540
I was taught never to waste food,

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:02.910
but I can't believe
he would eat the leftovers of a cat.

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:06.710
He hears one thing and understands ten.

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:09.670
I believe he is
the most skilled doctor in this county.

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:12.800
The reason he is living a poor life
in the Pleasure District is because

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:15.680
he has no greed or ambition.

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:19.310
Miss, what are you making over there?

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:21.980
I'm preparing mugwort for
Lady Gyokuyou's moxibustion treatment.

00:02:22.060 --> 00:02:23.480
Maomao,

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:26.730
ask Mr. Guen for his permission first.

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:27.860
Okay…

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:31.860
Are you going to be writing today?

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:35.530
Yes, since I have no duties at the moment.

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.490
The reason my old man was not assigned
to the Jade Pavilion,

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:40.030
but to the medical office,

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:43.040
was likely
through Lord Jinshi's consideration.

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:46.370
Currently in the rear palace,

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:48.540
there is one more lady who
is carrying the Emperor's child.

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:50.590
It's Lady Lihua.

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:54.130
I hope the next child grows up healthy.

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:57.640
For that to happen,
a safe delivery must take place.

00:02:58.430 --> 00:03:00.390
If my old man can assist both consorts,

00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:01.810
it would be a relief.

00:03:02.390 --> 00:03:04.930
By the way, I heard some new maids

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:06.770
have entered the Crystal Pavilion.

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:10.360
You know, since the head
lady-in-waiting we met before resigned.

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:13.190
I heard most of the new maids are older,

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:15.990
and the atmosphere in the palace
has calmed down all of a sudden.

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:19.740
It's good to have more experienced maids.

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:22.910
The rear palace is full of
young palace women,

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:25.120
but there are hardly any older ones.

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:29.420
The rear palace is a place to give birth
to the Emperor's children and raise them.

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:31.540
But it's currently not doing that.

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:33.800
If you think about how many children

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:36.300
the current emperor has,
it's clear that there's a problem.

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:37.800
I'm sure my old man

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:40.430
has already realized it by now.

00:03:41.470 --> 00:03:43.100
I think I'm done.

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:44.140
What is it?

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:48.390
It's a list of concerns I have
regarding the rear palace.

00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:50.360
Let me see.

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:52.860
Mr. Luomen,
you have beautiful handwriting.

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:54.570
That's what caught your attention?

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:57.650
But these sentences sound a bit childish.

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:00.030
Don't you think your sentences
could use more weight?

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:01.530
It's fine as it is.

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:04.040
There are still those here
who can only understand

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:05.700
simple words and sentences.

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:10.170
I see. He wants the attendants and maids
to be able to read this.

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:13.420
Do you think I missed anything?

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:14.960
It seems good.

00:04:15.760 --> 00:04:16.840
Mr. Guen,

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:20.430
does your family home have paper
about this size?

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:22.470
That size would be considered scrap,

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:25.350
so we would turn it into pulp
and make new paper instead.

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:30.100
If that's the case, could you sell those
to me at a lower price?

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:31.850
I think I can.

00:04:32.690 --> 00:04:36.360
Maomao, I heard that the institute of
practical studies was opened recently.

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:38.780
Then, could you ask them
if they can use this

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:41.860
to practice writing?

00:04:43.030 --> 00:04:46.790
So, he wants to mass-produce these
with the students' help?

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:48.370
I'll try to ask.

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:50.370
Thank you.

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:53.040
He doesn't waste people or resources.

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:55.380
He uses everything he can,
just like a merchant.

00:04:56.380 --> 00:05:00.340
Yet, why does he not use that ability to
enhance his own life?

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:04.550
I've finished preparing the mugwort,
so I will be leaving.

00:05:05.390 --> 00:05:08.640
Could I take some alcohol to
the Jade Pavilion for disinfecting?

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:10.480
Go ahead.

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:14.770
Also, is there anything
for relieving fatigue?

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:19.490
Lady Gyokuyou has been saying
she gets tired easily.

00:05:21.950 --> 00:05:23.870
Hey, my clothes will rip.

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:26.370
What's wrong, Maomao? Why are you crying?

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:28.370
Is it this?

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:32.330
This is not for you.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:36.710
All right, what should I do first?

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:38.840
Should I go to the institute
of practical studies?

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:41.760
If I have it go through Lord Jinshi,

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:43.720
it'll probably take time.

00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:48.890
I have this with me just in case…

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:51.140
But the last time I wore this…

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:56.020
Isn't that the hairpin you got
from Lord Jinshi at the garden party?

00:05:56.110 --> 00:05:57.650
Why are you wearing it all of a sudden?

00:05:59.110 --> 00:06:00.070
I'll wear it later.

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:06.160
This is… Luomen's handwriting.

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:07.870
You can tell?

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:10.580
Back when we were doing
our civil service examination,

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:12.160
people said that you would pass

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:14.080
if you wrote like him.

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:16.040
So we all copied his handwriting.

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:19.130
He had the skills
to become a great civil servant,

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:20.880
but feeling sorry and wanting to help

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:23.300
the sick homeless children,

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:25.130
he chose to become a physician.

00:06:25.220 --> 00:06:28.970
Actually, right now,
he's back in the rear palace.

00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:31.640
Oh. I didn't know that.

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:35.020
Is Xiolan not with you today?

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:38.190
Recently, she's been preoccupied with work

00:06:38.270 --> 00:06:40.400
and the rumors of the new eunuch.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:41.980
She doesn't have extra time.

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:44.490
A young eunuch, huh?

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:47.030
I know there's
not much excitement around here,

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:50.450
but making a fuss over them
is a bit excessive.

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:51.990
What do you mean by that?

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:54.370
At first, the eunuchs

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:56.460
were placed in the southern area.

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:59.710
But the palace women
began to neglect their duties.

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:02.260
That's why some eunuchs were sent
to the northern area.

00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:04.090
The palace women at the clinic

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:07.340
are saying that
the eunuchs are quite helpful.

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:08.800
The clinic, huh?

00:07:10.100 --> 00:07:13.890
I bet Shenlü is making good use of
the young eunuchs.

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:16.190
Anyways, what can I do for you today?

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:17.100
Oh, yes.

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:20.110
I was wondering
if you could ask the students

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:23.320
to use this letter that my old man wrote
to practice writing?

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:25.240
We will provide the paper.

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:28.410
I see. You want them to write copies.

00:07:28.490 --> 00:07:30.830
-So you can distribute them, right?
-Yes.

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:35.660
A long time ago,
I wrote something similar.

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:38.500
At first, Luomen was writing by himself,

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:40.880
so I felt I had to help him.

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:43.590
We wrote papers together

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:45.380
to post all over the rear palace.

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:48.180
He's grown older now,

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:51.680
so he's finally learned
how to make use of people.

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:56.270
Have you written and posted
something similar to this before?

00:07:57.640 --> 00:08:00.230
Yes, when Luomen was a physician.

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:02.150
So I believe it was over 20 years ago.

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:05.900
I remember we posted it
all over the rear palace.

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:09.530
"Don't use face powder that contains lead.

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:11.620
Avoid strong perfumes.

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:14.790
Don't pick palace plants
without permission."

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:18.370
What's written is pretty much
the same from back then.

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:21.460
He posted something similar to this?

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:23.380
What is this bad feeling I have?

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:26.090
I will bring you the paper later.

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:32.470
My old man must have posted it
out of concern for the women.

00:08:33.470 --> 00:08:35.890
But such notices also risked
giving malicious people

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:38.640
bad ideas.

00:08:39.310 --> 00:08:41.100
The palace staff turns over

00:08:41.190 --> 00:08:43.150
almost entirely every two years.

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:46.400
Even the consorts were replaced
after the late emperor's death.

00:08:47.030 --> 00:08:50.030
Who would still remember
the old notice from back then?

00:08:50.110 --> 00:08:51.110
That is…

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:52.660
Excuse me.

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:55.030
Oh.

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:57.580
You're from the Jade Pavilion.

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:59.460
Ms. Shenlü.

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:02.460
-Are you sick?
-Um… no.

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:06.420
How should I bring it up?

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.970
Oh, I brought you some alcohol.

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:12.550
It's distilled and stronger,

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:14.550
so I think it will be a good disinfectant.

00:09:14.640 --> 00:09:16.850
I can really have this?

00:09:16.930 --> 00:09:19.730
Yes, I made extra.

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:22.850
Thank you. Let me prepare some tea.

00:09:27.110 --> 00:09:29.690
By the way, everyone working here is

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:31.650
quite competent, aren't they?

00:09:31.740 --> 00:09:32.780
What do you mean by that?

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:36.330
The typical work duration for palace women
in the rear palace is about two years,

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:38.700
but most of the people here
have worked longer than that.

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:41.410
Well, we're a bunch of old women.

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:46.210
If they entered in their teens or
twenties, they've been here over 20 years.

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:49.340
Is there a reason
they cannot leave the rear palace?

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:53.180
We were young when we first entered.

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:56.510
I entered the rear palace
when I was ten years old.

00:09:57.430 --> 00:10:01.310
The other women were around that age too.

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:03.730
In the current rear palace,

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:06.650
such a young girl is not allowed
to work in the palace.

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:09.320
But in the previous emperor's era…

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:12.490
The late emperor would choose young girls,

00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:15.410
not yet of age, and steal their innocence.

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:17.410
The ones he defiled

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:20.040
weren't even allowed to leave.

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:22.370
Once they've slept with the emperor,

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:25.250
they cannot leave the rear palace,
even if they're ordinary palace women.

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:29.550
Nobody took us in.

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:33.260
Not now, not ever.

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:36.510
Oh, now I see.

00:10:37.850 --> 00:10:40.350
Towards the rear palace, the emperor,

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:44.020
and the consorts who were
favored by the emperor…

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:47.360
This is where their malice festered.

00:10:49.190 --> 00:10:50.400
Previously Shenlü

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:53.690
asked me to check on a maid who had
fallen ill at the Crystal Pavilion,

00:10:53.780 --> 00:10:55.950
as she was deeply worried about her.

00:10:56.030 --> 00:10:59.370
At that time, I thought
she was an attentive person.

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:00.280
But perhaps…

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:03.620
Maybe it was Shenlü who taught Lady Shin,

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:05.960
the head lady-in-waiting
of the Crystal Pavilion,

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:07.290
how to make the abortion medicine.

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:09.790
Although not directly,

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:13.170
what if she used that bedridden maid
to do so?

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:18.220
I can't stop coughing.

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:19.510
Let me take a look.

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:22.970
Is it contagious?

00:11:23.060 --> 00:11:24.730
Is there something concerning?

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:27.690
I don't want to get Lady Lihua sick.

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:32.440
She may be pregnant.

00:11:32.530 --> 00:11:33.360
Oh…

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:36.700
Give this to Shin,
the head lady-in-waiting.

00:11:36.780 --> 00:11:38.030
What is it?

00:11:38.110 --> 00:11:40.570
A list of things to avoid
during a pregnancy.

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:43.540
If you combine some of those things,
it can become an abortion medicine.

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:46.910
I'm sure it will be useful for Lady Lihua.

00:11:48.460 --> 00:11:49.960
The things to avoid also teach

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:54.420
what poison is
to those with ill intentions.

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:57.510
That's when the caravan came,

00:11:57.590 --> 00:11:59.970
and the ingredients on the list
happened to be sold.

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:03.100
There's no way
she would miss this opportunity.

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:06.100
Why were such ingredients being sold?

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:07.850
Maybe some palace women at the clinic

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:11.610
were telling the sellers that
they wanted a certain perfume.

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:15.940
We can't say for sure that the clinic
was involved with all the incidents.

00:12:16.030 --> 00:12:18.280
But this slow, creeping malice,

00:12:18.360 --> 00:12:20.990
short of outright murder, must have
been eating away at the rear palace

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:22.740
for some time now.

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:27.540
Should I press her further?

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:29.920
Is something the matter?

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:32.080
It's nothing.

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:34.300
Oh, okay then.

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:37.510
I'll stop for now.

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:39.380
I don't have any proof or any witnesses.

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:41.590
I don't want to make vague accusations.

00:12:41.680 --> 00:12:44.470
This is the only place
where the sick palace women

00:12:44.560 --> 00:12:47.310
can feel safe.
I don't want to take that away from them.

00:12:48.060 --> 00:12:51.270
The only thing I can do is

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:54.230
prevent this malice from spreading.

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:55.440
Um…

00:12:55.940 --> 00:12:58.360
Thank you. I will be taking my leave.

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:03.620
If there are any books you'd like
to borrow, please go ahead.

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:05.450
But just don't forget to return them.

00:13:06.290 --> 00:13:07.950
There are so many books.

00:13:08.500 --> 00:13:12.000
For some reason, the number of books
on that shelf seems to be increasing.

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:14.500
It would be fine if they just return it.

00:13:15.380 --> 00:13:18.050
This is quite
an impressive insect encyclopedia.

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:21.010
Someone left that on the bookshelf too.

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:23.760
Maybe a month ago.

00:13:27.560 --> 00:13:28.890
This is…

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:32.480
If it was one month ago, that would've
been after the envoy's banquet.

00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:34.310
Come to think of it…

00:13:34.400 --> 00:13:36.570
This place is amazing!

00:13:36.650 --> 00:13:39.240
It's full of insects
from the encyclopedia!

00:13:39.820 --> 00:13:42.990
Did Shisui leave this encyclopedia here?

00:13:43.570 --> 00:13:47.490
But could a mere maid own
such an impressive book?

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:51.620
Thinking back,
when Shisui was drawing insects,

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:54.080
she was using a paper notebook.

00:13:54.170 --> 00:13:55.880
Plus, she was able to read.

00:13:56.590 --> 00:13:58.500
Why is she working as a maid then?

00:14:00.550 --> 00:14:03.970
Shenlü, be careful of that girl.

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:06.470
It's a high-pitched voice for a man.

00:14:06.550 --> 00:14:08.970
But a deep voice for a woman.

00:14:09.060 --> 00:14:11.480
He's short for a man.

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:14.230
But tall for a woman.

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:20.730
She's handsome enough to make
the ladies squeal…

00:14:22.820 --> 00:14:24.820
It's Suirei.

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:29.160
Shenlü, she has managed to
see through what you have done

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:30.910
from your conversation.

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:34.920
She's sharp as usual.

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:38.040
Because of her,
I couldn't become a dead body.

00:14:38.130 --> 00:14:40.130
Should I scream?

00:14:40.210 --> 00:14:42.840
Or should I throw a bottle of alcohol
at her and make a run for it?

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:46.220
Don't think about doing anything stupid.
I'll hurt you if you move.

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:50.100
If you kill me here,
you'll be caught right away.

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:52.640
I'd like to settle this peacefully.

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:57.560
Is it an aftereffect
of the revival medicine?

00:14:58.900 --> 00:15:00.980
After the assassination attempt
at the mid festival,

00:15:01.070 --> 00:15:03.690
you "died" by drinking poison.

00:15:03.780 --> 00:15:05.820
You made it look that way.

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:09.740
The medicine only put you
in a temporary death-like state,

00:15:09.830 --> 00:15:11.490
but there are lingering effects.

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:13.450
So, what?

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:15.660
Let me tell you what I want.

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:17.460
Do you think I will listen?

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:18.670
You have no other choice.

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:22.710
Shisui!

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:25.470
So she was the owner
of that insect encyclopedia.

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:27.840
Sorry, Maomao…

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:30.470
Do you not care what happens to her?

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:32.890
What do you want me to do?

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:35.430
I want you to leave
the rear palace with me.

00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:38.480
Leave the rear palace?
That's not possible…

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:40.730
It is. And…

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:43.150
I know that you will come with me.

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:47.490
Don't you want to know

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:50.120
how to make the revival medicine?

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:56.080
What is she saying?

00:15:57.160 --> 00:15:59.830
As I thought, Suirei is dangerous.

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:07.840
There are two beasts in the palace.
One to the East and one to the West.

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:11.260
The military resides in the East,
so one beast is a military officer.

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:14.970
The West represents the civil officials,
so the other beast is one of them.

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:17.640
In other words, the grand commandant.

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:21.400
The high-ranking military officer Lakan
is the fox of the East.

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:23.690
A prominent figure since the days
of the former leader

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:25.900
is Shishou, who governs Shihoku-shu.

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:27.990
He is the raccoon dog of the West.

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:29.740
What has brought you here?

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:31.870
Oh, nothing special.

00:16:31.950 --> 00:16:35.790
It's been a month since the Emperor's
younger brother attended the court council

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:38.410
so I was thinking
we could have tea after this.

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:40.670
It's a great opportunity,

00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:43.500
so why not join me, Sir Shishou?

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:45.920
Me?

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:50.090
Although I don't have
any interesting stories to share.

00:16:52.590 --> 00:16:54.810
He says he will join.

00:16:54.890 --> 00:16:58.770
All right.
Let's head to the courtyard then.

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:03.770
What beautiful autumn weather.

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:06.320
I have them served in silver cups,

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:09.030
so there is no need for a food taster.

00:17:16.990 --> 00:17:18.660
He says it tastes delicious.

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:24.130
Lakan, is there something
you would like to discuss?

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:26.960
The other day, there was
an attempted assassination

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:29.760
of the Emperor's younger brother
in Shihoku-shu, wasn't there?

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:34.090
During that investigation,
we got our hands on something interesting.

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:38.350
A design for a feifa?!

00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:43.060
Do you have any idea what this is,
Lord Shishou?

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:46.400
What is this?

00:17:46.980 --> 00:17:49.820
It's the weapon that
the culprits were carrying.

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:51.110
Isn't that right?

00:17:53.360 --> 00:17:55.370
Excuse me, please continue.

00:17:55.990 --> 00:17:59.700
This is a diagram of the weapon.

00:17:59.790 --> 00:18:02.040
It seems to be the newest model
from the West.

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:05.210
Here, instead of a matchlock,

00:18:05.290 --> 00:18:07.170
there's a flint attached here.

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:11.380
Which means fewer misfires
and the build is rather simple.

00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:14.510
That is impressive.

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:17.810
If we mass produce these,

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:20.600
the way we fight will definitely change.

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:23.810
We can fight in a tighter formation
and move more freely.

00:18:23.890 --> 00:18:25.600
I can't believe such weapons

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:29.860
ended up in the hands of someone
targeting the emperor's brother…

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:34.070
I wonder how they
got their hands on these?

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:39.660
I wonder?

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:45.620
Isn't it your job to investigate that?

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:47.920
You can say that, but…

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:50.050
Well, there's been a small problem.

00:18:50.840 --> 00:18:53.970
Someone in that department
got a little too rough with the culprits.

00:18:54.050 --> 00:18:56.260
So none of those captured
are able to speak now.

00:18:57.510 --> 00:19:00.930
There's no mercy for those
who plot against the royals,

00:19:01.010 --> 00:19:04.560
but botching the torture?
That's a costly mistake.

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:06.100
So I was wondering

00:19:06.190 --> 00:19:09.440
if you have heard of anything about that,

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:10.690
Lord Shishou?

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:14.440
If I knew,
I would've reported it long ago.

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:17.450
I see. What a shame.

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:20.990
Let's get to the main discussion then.

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:25.790
It's a diagram of the game of Go
my wife and I played yesterday.

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:28.500
Wife…?

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:32.840
Come to think of it, you recently
got married, didn't you, Lakan?

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:33.960
Yes, I did.

00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:38.430
I heard the celebrations went on
for seven days and nights.

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:41.720
You even know that?

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:44.980
She's a sharp one, my wife.

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:47.770
Every move she makes is
like a finely sharpened blade.

00:19:47.850 --> 00:19:50.940
I can't tell you how many times my heart
raced while we were playing.

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:53.190
Look at this move! I would escape,

00:19:53.280 --> 00:19:55.610
but then she would get me
on the next move!

00:19:56.450 --> 00:19:59.030
How long do we have to
listen to this story?

00:19:59.110 --> 00:20:01.200
-And then--
-I apologize but…

00:20:01.280 --> 00:20:03.660
I have business to attend to.
I will take my leave.

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:05.410
Thank you for the drink.

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:07.120
What a shame.

00:20:07.870 --> 00:20:10.580
I'll make sure to send you a copy
of the diagram

00:20:10.670 --> 00:20:12.960
and my commentary notes along with it.

00:20:13.050 --> 00:20:14.760
No, there's no need to.

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:17.590
No need to hesitate. Also,

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:20.550
would you like a glass of grape juice?

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:23.350
The red color really stands out

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:25.560
in a glass cup.

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:30.520
Indeed, it's beautiful.

00:20:31.810 --> 00:20:32.940
Right?

00:20:33.730 --> 00:20:35.820
I feel like you and I will get along well.

00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:38.700
I'd like to chat more
about my wife sometime.

00:20:38.780 --> 00:20:40.950
Maybe next time. Farewell.

00:20:45.040 --> 00:20:48.620
This juice has an unusual color,
doesn't it?

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:50.960
There are even grapes out there

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:53.340
with a ‘green' hue.

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:56.880
That's clearly green, not red…

00:20:56.960 --> 00:20:59.720
Why didn't Lord Shishou say anything

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:01.590
when he said it was red?

00:21:02.930 --> 00:21:04.890
Just as my uncle said…

00:21:09.980 --> 00:21:12.060
May I fix my hair?

00:21:12.690 --> 00:21:14.480
Go ahead.

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:16.900
I'll keep watch to make sure no one comes.

00:21:17.530 --> 00:21:19.610
Finally, I can take off this mask.

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:29.710
Wearing platform shoes
is quite exhausting.

00:21:30.210 --> 00:21:32.250
I'm sorry for asking you
for such a request.

00:21:32.830 --> 00:21:36.500
Standing in for the Crown Prince
isn't something you get to do every day.

00:21:36.590 --> 00:21:37.960
I quite enjoyed it.

00:21:38.920 --> 00:21:42.470
Looking at her, she's like
a beautiful civil servant.

00:21:42.550 --> 00:21:46.470
Who would guess this is Lady Ah-Duo,
the former high-ranking consort?

00:21:46.560 --> 00:21:50.350
The fox was so eccentric
that it made the raccoon dog seem normal.

00:21:50.430 --> 00:21:53.650
No one stands a chance
against the General.

00:21:53.730 --> 00:21:55.400
He seems to have a soft spot
for his wife though.

00:21:55.980 --> 00:21:57.900
Yes, and his daughter too.

00:21:57.980 --> 00:22:00.650
To think she's the General's daughter…

00:22:01.360 --> 00:22:04.570
But isn't he scrambling to deal with
the situation with that girl?

00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:06.450
The eunuch, Jinshi.

00:22:08.540 --> 00:22:11.960
To think she would go missing…

00:23:46.010 --> 00:24:00.950
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:57.250 --> 00:24:00.930
Next episode: The Village of Foxes

00:24:00.140 --> 00:24:00.930
Subtitle translation by:
Abhishek Chand Ramola
